WEB→NATIVE PARITY MAP (TripReplayCharts.tsx is the spec; every branch + t() reproduced)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  ChartContainer title "Speed & Power Timeline"   → TripReplayChartsHeader [i18n replay.timeline.title]
